  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Meet my pets! My name is Mia. I am seven years old. How old are you? I live next to Lily. My house is white. Three people live in my house. They are Mom, Dad, and me. I do not have a sister. Lily is like my sister.",
      "I love animals! I have three pets. I have a gray cat. She likes milk. She sleeps on my bed. I have a blue bird too. He sings a song in the morning. I have a small orange fish. It lives in water. It is very happy in the water. Do you have a pet? What is your pet's name?",
      "My grandma has a chicken. I see it at her house. The chicken gives her an egg. \"Good morning, chicken!\" I say. Lily comes to see my pets. She likes the cat and the bird. Pip is her dog. He says, \"Woof!\" at my cat. My cat looks at him. What is your favorite animal?"
    ],
    "summary": "Mia tells us her name, her age, and her home. She shows us her pets and asks the reader about pets.",
